        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Sagittarius &mdash; 4th (Ultimate) Technique, gained at level 16.</em></p><p><em>You take on the aspect of the constellation itself.</em></p><p>For 10 minutes you gain a fly Speed equal to <strong>twice your Speed</strong>, you can Fly at full speed while attacking without penalty, and @UUID[Compendium.isaacs-hb-pf2e.saint-techniques.Item.Golden Arrow] becomes a <strong>1-action</strong> Technique that costs no Focus Point.</p><p>You may also share flight with up to five allies within 30 feet, each gaining a fly Speed equal to their own Speed for the duration.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The duration increases by 5 minutes.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
